              },
              {
                "fontFamily": "Liberation Sans",
                "fontSize": 11,
                "text": "مرحبا",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "fontFamily": "Liberation Sans",
                "fontSize": 11,
                "text": ", then more English.",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block-13",
            "spaceAfter": 8,
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "fontFamily": "Liberation Sans",
                "fontSize": 11,
                "text": "Arabic-Indic digits: ١٢٣٤٥٦٧٨٩٠ and Hebrew with niqqud: שָׁלוֹם",
