            "id": "block-17",
            "spaceAfter": 8,
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "alignment": "justify",
            "content": [
              {
                "fontFamily": "Liberation Sans",
                "fontSize": 11,
                "text": "这是一个用于测试中文排版的示例段落，包含标点符号、数字 2026 和英文单词 Spindle。",
