              {
                "fontFamily": "DejaVu Sans",
                "fontSize": 11,
                "text": "Unicode symbols: © ® ™ € £ ¥ § ¶ † ‡ • … ← → ↔ ⇒ ∀ ∃ ∑ ∏ ∞ ≈ ≠ ≤ ≥ ± × ÷ √ ∫ ♠ ♣ ♥ ♦ ☀ ☂ ☎ ✓ ✔ ✘ ★",
